00:52:38.740 --> 00:52:40.520
and if anybody's going to sing, it's going to be me.

00:52:40.680 --> 00:52:40.900
Yeah.

00:52:41.320 --> 00:52:43.630
But, Dennis, wait a minute.

00:52:44.050 --> 00:52:45.050
Rovanna's my guest.

00:52:45.270 --> 00:52:46.010
I don't care.

00:52:46.010 --> 00:52:47.230
I sing as good as he does.

00:52:47.490 --> 00:52:48.530
Oh, thank you, Don.

00:52:48.670 --> 00:52:50.330
Dennis, don't be ridiculous.

00:52:51.110 --> 00:52:51.470
Jack.

00:52:51.770 --> 00:52:51.930
What?

00:52:52.090 --> 00:52:54.270
If he wants to sing, let him.

00:52:54.590 --> 00:52:54.950
Yeah!

00:52:56.280 --> 00:52:59.170
Well, okay, kid, what do you want to sing?

00:52:59.330 --> 00:52:59.970
Your favorite...

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:01.840
Remember, cuando caliente el sol.

00:53:02.260 --> 00:53:03.280
Okay, all right.

00:53:03.740 --> 00:53:05.140
I gave him a broken cup.

00:53:33.760 --> 00:53:56.110
Give me your love, for a moment, for a-

00:54:18.520 --> 00:54:20.780
That's bad. Look what's happening to the birthday cake.

00:54:42.000 --> 00:54:45.200
Ladies and gentlemen, between Dennis Day and those penguins...

00:54:45.200 --> 00:54:47.200
Hold on, Mr. Benny. It's time to do the commercial.

00:54:47.760 --> 00:54:48.880
Oh, oh, the commercial.

00:54:48.980 --> 00:54:51.500
Yes. Here's the coffee for you to rehearse while we set the stage.

00:54:51.720 --> 00:54:52.060
Thank you.

00:54:52.480 --> 00:54:53.240
Bring the microphone in.

00:54:53.640 --> 00:54:55.200
All right, light's up. Let's bring the sets in.

00:54:55.460 --> 00:54:59.980
Let's see. Fill up with Texaco Sky Chief, because it...

00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:03.680
can drive down the cost of driving, can save you money.

00:55:03.720 --> 00:55:06.220
So you really should fill up.

00:55:07.000 --> 00:55:08.800
Remember, we'll pay you to fill up,

00:55:08.800 --> 00:55:13.220
because Sky Chief keeps deposits from building up on valves

00:55:13.220 --> 00:55:15.420
better than any other leading asset.

00:55:16.380 --> 00:55:20.100
So ladies and gentlemen, get Texaco Sky Chief

00:55:20.100 --> 00:55:24.050
and tell the man to fill it up.

00:55:24.380 --> 00:55:26.140
Yes, sir, Mr. Benny. Fill it up.

00:55:33.070 --> 00:55:56.920
one gallon please well that's it but somebody handed me a wire just i came on from my very good

00:55:56.920 --> 00:55:58.680
friend george burns

00:56:00.090 --> 00:56:04.020
It says here, uh, dear Jack, happy birthday.

00:56:04.820 --> 00:56:12.810
And I, I didn't know you could send a wire like this.

00:56:15.870 --> 00:56:19.950
Anyway, I want to thank all of my guests for being on my show.

00:56:20.310 --> 00:56:22.590
And Lucy, Lucy, come back here a minute, will you please?

00:56:26.070 --> 00:56:29.480
Lucy, now that the show is over.

00:56:30.510 --> 00:56:33.170
How about going out and having a little drink with me?

00:56:34.540 --> 00:56:37.880
Why, Jack Benny, I'm surprised at you.

00:56:38.290 --> 00:56:41.910
You're a happily married man, and I'm a happily married woman.

00:56:41.970 --> 00:56:44.130
How could you make a suggestion like that?

00:56:44.370 --> 00:56:48.180
Well, I just asked you to go out and have a little drink with me, that's all.

00:56:48.360 --> 00:56:50.720
Oh, sure, it sounds innocent enough,

00:56:50.860 --> 00:56:55.160
but it becomes a secret rendezvous in the dimly lit cocktail lounge

00:56:55.160 --> 00:56:57.840
with romantic music playing in the background.

00:56:58.120 --> 00:56:59.580
Really, I'm surprised at you, Jack.

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:01.120
What would Mary think?

00:57:01.770 --> 00:57:03.570
Well, Mary's coming with us.

00:57:04.050 --> 00:57:05.090
Then forget it.

00:57:12.400 --> 00:57:15.760
That's my show for tonight, and I hope you enjoyed it.

00:57:16.320 --> 00:57:19.220
And thank you all for coming to my birthday party.

00:57:19.770 --> 00:57:29.360
The Benny's Birthday Special has been brought to you by...

00:57:35.440 --> 00:57:37.180
Makers of Texaco Sky Chief.

00:57:37.380 --> 00:57:39.840
The gasoline that can drive down the cost of driving.

00:57:40.100 --> 00:57:41.260
And save you money.

00:57:41.540 --> 00:57:42.880
So fill it up, Jack.

00:57:44.520 --> 00:57:45.180
Mr. Benny.

00:57:45.580 --> 00:57:51.000
More and more people trust their car to the man who wears the Texaco Star.

00:58:50.830 --> 00:58:53.970
This Sunday, beginning at 6.30, 5.30 Central Time,

00:58:54.230 --> 00:58:56.850
a glowing ballet version of a timeless classic,

00:58:57.440 --> 00:58:59.870
Little Women, narrated by Geraldine Page.

00:59:00.060 --> 00:59:00.140
We'll be right back.
